text = "Recent changes:
 - Camera moves around all fancy like
 - Can save/load game and persist:
    - Number of koyins
    - Current Level
    - Position within level
Still can't:
 - Kill enemies
 - Collect from chests
 - Die (but you can lose hearts)
Earlier changes:
 - Slashable grass with random loot drops
 - Sensitive weed
 - Water splash effects (still WIP)
 - Pushable logs and crates"

